  "scope": "Only listed product scripts, compiled runtime and bundle files are deployable. Choose one complete V34/V33/V32/V28/V22 baseline. A null before hash requires the exact path to be absent; it never permits replacing an unchecked file. Preserve all private identities/configuration/state and independent source.",
